# =======================================================
# Care Companion - Environment Variables
# Assignment + Midterm Web Application (Next.js + Supabase)
# =======================================================

# 1. Supabase Project URL & Public Anon Key
# หาได้จาก: Supabase Dashboard -> Project Settings -> API
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-supabase-anon-key

# 2. Supabase Service Role Key (สำหรับการจัดการสิทธิ์ Admin / Server Actions)
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=your-supabase-service-role-key

# 3. Google OAuth Setup
# ตั้งค่า Google Client ID & Secret ใน Supabase Dashboard:
# Authentication -> Providers -> Google -> Enabled -> กรอก Client ID & Secret
# และเพิ่ม Authorized redirect URIs ใน Google Cloud Console:
# https://<your-project-ref>.supabase.co/auth/v1/callback
